   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Halcyon Grid met all three covenants on the Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026, and the compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculations in each case. The main change is a steady decline in headroom on Minimum Unrestricted Cash since August, with a cushion of {{fact:48ab5ad1-850d-426f-9455-dd7b3b7bd3fd}} at period end. Revenue to Plan stands at {{fact:0a97fcef-3150-435f-b605-12ceb75fad9f}}, so the cash decline does not appear to come from weaker sales. No open items await a decision this period.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was calculated at {{fact:ae6208e2-ba27-4893-8b56-65f039e02372}} against a required {{fact:cce4793c-fc60-49a5-bec3-225ae7595ea2}}, a cushion of {{fact:04d935c9-23e1-4712-8684-3dc26c88986b}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was {{fact:7c239e69-991c-46fc-a0f6-55507edb8e7b}} against a floor of {{fact:031baf93-5cd6-4ac7-a7c0-46230cff716c}}, a cushion of {{fact:48ab5ad1-850d-426f-9455-dd7b3b7bd3fd}}. Revenue to Plan was {{fact:0a97fcef-3150-435f-b605-12ceb75fad9f}} against a minimum of {{fact:ca916d4e-9eaa-40d4-a7ee-17d5d9e71083}}, a cushion of {{fact:e81f3395-aa39-4bda-a6e2-af0909d9a98e}}. The certificate reports {{fact:44cde4ae-eaa7-422f-afbe-31dc5069879a}}, {{fact:3547e8a2-ecae-40db-9013-19b30d22e730}} and {{fact:dcd2efcb-6c18-4d0f-b1dc-0f0fe5304d38}} respectively, matching the bank's calculations, and claims compliance on all three.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"Two low-severity signals fired, both on falling covenant headroom. The more significant concerns Minimum Unrestricted Cash: headroom has declined each month since August to {{fact:48ab5ad1-850d-426f-9455-dd7b3b7bd3fd}}, with cash of {{fact:7c239e69-991c-46fc-a0f6-55507edb8e7b}} against a {{fact:031baf93-5cd6-4ac7-a7c0-46230cff716c}} floor. The signal attributes the decline to spending rather than sales, though the bank holds no expense or burn facts for this period to confirm that, and a reviewer may wish to check the trend. The second signal notes a small reduction in Revenue to Plan headroom to {{fact:e81f3395-aa39-4bda-a6e2-af0909d9a98e}}. There are no open work items.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
